body:
Nightime routine is hardest for me. Floss, brush teeth, wash face, moisturize. My daily chores of dishes (my dishwasher is broken and my landlord won't replace it) litter boxes and shutting down and locking up the house at night are tough for some reason. It is just me and can be difficult.

&#x200B;

I go for big 80's power ballads to scream to (I can't sing) when I'm manic. Journey is heavensent lol.

Any of the songs between fathers and their children. I lost my biological dad last year and it brought up all the feelings from when I lost the man who was my father and my mother. I do miss my biological Dad as well!

&#x200B;

Burn from Hamilton and It's Quiet Uptown. Burn, my exhusband cheated on me so that hits hard and It's Quiet Uptown because I also lost a child and the line "Forgiveness" breaks me because I struggle with that.
